                        <div class="info-value">Aircraft, missiles, established codes</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">🌊 Boundary Layers</div>
                        <div class="info-value">Airfoil flows, external aerodynamics</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">💾 Simple Implementation</div>
                        <div class="info-value">One equation, lower memory</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">📐 Wall-Bounded Flows</div>
                        <div class="info-value">Channels, ducts with good wall treatment</div>
